+            TextLine("warfarin or a product that contains", 0.95f, block = 2),
+            TextLine("aspirin.", 0.95f, block = 3),
+        ))
+        val texts = parser.parse(label).map { it.text }
+        assertEquals(listOf("paracetamol"), texts)
